            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EThis photograph from Stockton-on-Tees is reproduced with the permission of \u003Ca href=\u0022http://www.picturestockton.co.uk\u0022\u003EStockton Library Service\u003C/a\u003E. Please contact them if you would like to use it for any other purpose.\u003C/p\u003E"
